<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">记录今天的小发现</text><text class="title">拍下这道错题</text><text class="subtitle">让难题有迹可循，让复习更轻松。</text><view class="photo" bindtap="chooseImage"><image wx:if="{{localImage}}" src="{{localImage}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view wx:else><text class="photo-icon">＋</text><text class="photo-title">拍照或从相册导入</text><text class="muted">尽量拍清题目，保留完整内容</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{localImage}}" class="muted photo-tip">点击照片可重新选择</view><view class="card"><view class="row field"><text class="label">年级</text><input placeholder="如：三年级" value="{{form.grade}}" data-key="grade" bindinput="onInput"/></view><view class="row field"><text class="label">学科</text><input value="{{form.subject}}" data-key="subject" bindinput="onInput"/></view></view><view class="card"><text class="label">题目备注 <text class="muted">（选填）</text></text><textarea placeholder="补充题目文字或想记录的内容" value="{{form.questionText}}" data-key="questionText" bindinput="onInput"/></view><view class="card"><text class="label">我的答案（选填）</text><input value="{{form.userAnswer}}" data-key="userAnswer" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="当时是怎么回答的？"/><text class="label answer-label">正确答案（选填）</text><input value="{{form.correctAnswer}}" data-key="correctAnswer" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="记下正确答案"/></view><button class="primary" disabled="{{saving}}" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存到错题本</button></view>
